(7490843, 1192737, 112739, '<td valign="top">If my eyes don''t deceive me, this has to be a Mary Ann creation. If not, then please take that as a very high compliment! Expertly done.</td>', 'If my eyes don''t deceive me, this has to be a Mary Ann creation. If not, then please take that as a very high compliment! Expertly done.', '2017-01-06 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490855, 1191808, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a cute image.  I do wish you has moved closer and not included the bottom left items in the composition.</td>', 'This is a cute image.  I do wish you has moved closer and not included the bottom left items in the composition.', '2017-01-06 20:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490872, 1192650, 24744, '<td valign="top">you have some really nasty artefacts from the clumsy selection mask you used to do the fake background blur - it''s especially visible around the feathers near the bottom of the scene, the heron''s legs, and the one fin of the fish being artificially blurred.</td>', 'you have some really nasty artefacts from the clumsy selection mask you used to do the fake background blur - it''s especially visible around the feathers near the bottom of the scene, the heron''s legs, and the one fin of the fish being artificially blurred.', '2017-01-07 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490874, 1192640, 24744, '<td valign="top">Great shot and processing, only nitpick is that I would have removed the two big spots of flare on the fourth and fifth buildings in the upper left.</td>', 'Great shot and processing, only nitpick is that I would have removed the two big spots of flare on the fourth and fifth buildings in the upper left.', '2017-01-07 09:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490875, 1192128, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but I would have liked to see the apples in focus here, and the reflections on the vase slightly better controlled.</td>', 'Nice concept, but I would have liked to see the apples in focus here, and the reflections on the vase slightly better controlled.', '2017-01-07 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7490876, 1192350, 24744, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks for this challenge<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-01-08 06:55:23.</i></td>', 'One of my top picks for this challenge', '2017-01-07 09:28:56.000000', '2017-01-08 06:55:23.000000', 1),
(7490878, 1192747, 24744, '<td valign="top">Finally an image that actually benefits from the black and white treatment!  Good composition and tones; I especially like the detail of the skyline in the far distance.  My only two complaints are that there''s a tiny bit of sharpening halo around the foreground branch and the edge of the leftmost tree''s trunk, which I''d have cleaned up at the end, and that there''s some dark haloing around that tree and some odd shadows in the sky halfway to the left edge too.</td>', 'Finally an image that actually benefits from the black and white treatment!  Good composition and tones; I especially like the detail of the skyline in the far distance.  My only two complaints are that there''s a tiny bit of sharpening halo around the foreground branch and the edge of the leftmost tree''s trunk, which I''d have cleaned up at the end, and that there''s some dark haloing around that tree and some odd shadows in the sky halfway to the left edge too.', '2017-01-07 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
