(7491158, 1192790, 16148, '<td valign="top">I tried to leave a comment during voting but couldn''t express my feelings.  It''s a beautiful image but I have one minor nitpick.  The thick dark tree above the structure seems to heavy and dark.  Might be nice to lighten this one element.  For me it takes away from the one visible opening in the building.  Was a 7 from me.</td>', 'I tried to leave a comment during voting but couldn''t express my feelings.  It''s a beautiful image but I have one minor nitpick.  The thick dark tree above the structure seems to heavy and dark.  Might be nice to lighten this one element.  For me it takes away from the one visible opening in the building.  Was a 7 from me.', '2017-01-08 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
