(7491183, 1192350, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this image very much,congrats.  Is the lighting as simple as it looks or am I being mislead ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The lighting was the ambient lighting in the room when I knocked off the overheads, that bedside lamp and a funky purple strip above the bed that I have cropped out.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiny: I like this image very much,congrats.  Is the lighting as simple as it looks or am I being mislead ?   The lighting was the ambient lighting in the room when I knocked off the overheads, that bedside lamp and a funky purple strip above the bed that I have cropped out.', '2017-01-08 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
